WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Treat the COO as your chief of staff.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Delegate specialty work; watch Kanban for agent-owned status.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Standups roll team progress back to the COO.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Broadcast reaches many agents with pacing.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Use notify when you need a deliberate CEO alert — not for every token of chat...

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
This loop is daily adoption.
